Our game ends.
We sit by the side of the court.
We all drink water.
After a long time I played this much.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay play very well.
Neha says to me, "Maya, you play very well."
"You know how to play very well."
I smile and say, "Thank you, Neha."
Sanjay asks me, "Maya, will you come to play with us regularly?"
Amit also says, "Yes, you play with us."
"We like to play with you."
I become very happy.
I say to them, "Certainly!"
"We will always play together."
"I will come here every Thursday evening at half past five now."
They all become happy.
I get new friends in Mumbai.
